<decision #track.improve_modeling_authoring_guidance.legacy.d02 apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "historical-decision" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = false legacy_source = "codument/tracks/archived/2026-06/2026-06-21-1800-improve-modeling-authoring-guidance/decisions.md" } (
  <question ?m>
  2. 【P0】shell kind 标签写法
  </?m>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?m>
    - 背景：ecommerce 写 `<backend:endpoint>`（标签含冒号→XNL 语法错）。
    - 最终决策：唯一合法 = 元素标签用普通词（`<endpoint>`/`<route>`）+ `kind="backend:endpoint"` 属性；标签名禁含冒号（XNL 硬限制，不放宽）。规范加 Good/Bad。
    - 状态：confirmed
    </?m>
    <decision-text ?m>
